  "text": "This no-code workflow flags angry customer reviews and alerts your team on Slack. Unhappy customer tickets sit unnoticed in email queues while executive teams assume everything is fine. Delayed dispute resolution turns frustrated clients into public detractors on social media. Route incoming feedback through Zapier and OpenAI to trigger high-priority Slack notifications for negative ratings. Your support team intervenes within sixty seconds, eliminating costly client churn.",
